<title>USA: HFS, PHH holders to vote April 30.</title>
<headline>HFS, PHH holders to vote April 30.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>HFS Inc and PHH Corp said Wednesday that they will mail the proxy statement related to their proposed merger March 27 and that a shareholder vote on the merger has been set for April 30.</p>
<p>The companies said HFS shareholders of record March 3 and PHH shareholders of record January 31 are entitled to vote on the merger, the companies said.</p>
<p>HFS, the owner of Avis car rental system and a franchisor of hotels and residential real estate brokerage offices, agreed to merge with PHH in November in a deal valued at $1.7 billion.</p>
</text>
